# BELLHOP: levers and gates (C-6, TWO SWITCHES). A slashed lever swings
# every gate of its colour, open to shut and shut to open. Here the order
# matters: lever 2 opens the way to lever 1 but shuts the nook with the
# hidden tea spot, and lever 1 opens the exit but shuts the way back to
# lever 2. Flip both before finding the spot and the cup is lost for that
# visit: a crash doesn't swing the gates back. The demo pilot finds the
# spot first and takes the cup.
seed 1
game bellhop
wait 20
cheat stage 25
wait 2
expect tile_x318 == 10
expect tile_x520 == 9
expect tile_x658 == 7
expect tile_x32 == 8
# lever 2, from its right
cheat place 57 144
cheat face -1
press B
wait 2
expect tile_x318 == 9
expect tile_x520 == 10
expect tile_x658 == 7
# a lever swings once a slash
wait 30
# lever 1, inside the room lever 2 opened
cheat place 169 128
cheat face -1
press B
wait 2
expect tile_x658 == 8
expect tile_x32 == 7
expect tile_x318 == 9
# the nook is shut, and lever 2 is shut away: no tea this visit
expect cup == 0
# and a crash changes nothing
cheat crash
wait 80
expect mode == 0
expect tile_x318 == 9
expect tile_x520 == 10
expect tile_x658 == 8
expect tile_x32 == 7
expect cup == 0
# the right order, flown
cheat stage 25
wait 2
botuntil stage != 25 6000
expect stage == 26
expect tea == 1
